    {
      "id": "claim_ea8ea493aa404177ba80480c0425a541",
      "statement": "Without an assembly, preparation recalls Memory, Experience, and Topic Memory; with an assembly it recalls only the families its sections name. Round zero limits Memory candidates to 16, Experience to 8, and Topic Memory to 8 per the builder's candidate limits.",
