    {
      "id": "claim_345db94a3e5a4273ba43705fe200be87",
      "statement": "Embedding degradation is folded into one preparation reason in which inference_timeout outranks inference_unavailable; in auto mode, when the embedding times out or is unavailable and FTS is available, Atomic Memory search falls back to text retrieval instead of failing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
