    {
      "id": "claim_78a86bfb36ed492cb6a93dfcbb4d2cc2",
      "statement": "The builder raises PreparedContextInvariantError when accumulated candidate lists exceed their family ceilings, which are a guard after the recall loop has already applied those ceilings.",
