      "id": "claim_6b8e5ceb714e4586a30f46532c630031",
      "statement": "On the default path the builder interleaves Memory, Topic Memory, and Experience, keeps at most 8 entries and 2 Experience entries, caps each body at 2000 bytes, and raises an output-budget invariant when the rendered content exceeds max_bytes.",
      "evidence": [
