      "id": "claim_bf0caac60b0c41d1990341ab285d201a",
      "statement": "Errors raised during recall propagate out of preparation: an Atomic Memory search exception is re-raised after recording a failed search, and the HTTP layer maps inference timeouts and unavailability to 503 with codes inference_timeout and inference_unavailable, while unmapped exceptions become 500 internal_error.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/powercontext/builtin/runtime/application.py#L2025-L2040",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4e274d99ca91f163d0dd1a5b41b7f58d58b054b239aec665fd943cdb45edf76f:"
        },
        {
